{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Helix Planner 是一款支援 iPhone、Watch 與 CarPlay 的智能多語言任務規劃工具，適合需要整理待辦事項、設定位置提醒及跨裝置查看清單的使用者。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-145.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>跨裝置任務與位置提醒</h2>\n<p>可把任務按顏色與表情符號分類，加入筆記、附件及可選 GPS 座標；設定抵達或離開某地的位置提醒，並在地圖按分類或圖釘顏色篩選。開放任務可同步至 Watch，CarPlay 會鏡像 iPhone 的開放任務篩選，另支援貼上文字批次匯入、匯出已完成任務及多語言介面。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-135-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-136-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-137-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-138-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-139-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-140-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Helix Planner</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/helix-planner/id6759653903?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.256959+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":303,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T01:05:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T14:15:43.871862+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:14:04.376335+00:00","content_hash":"0d28188381cc3a5376c5c886f4883745e89a941fa97865269dc2d6eae46eff47","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}